title: 'Architecture session: Agent Manifest, Ambient Coordination, Lore Split, Data Sovereignty'
summary: 'Extended architecture session designing four foundational systems for the Paradigm Renaissance. Produced detailed specs for: (1) Agent Manifest with 6 new dimensions + dual learning layers, (2) Ambient Coordination via event stream + attention filtering + self-nomination + debate protocol, (3) Lore Split into work log / learning journal / team decisions, (4) IP and Data Sovereignty with four trust rings, always-on local brain, and three deployment tiers (individual/team/enterprise). All architecture is captured in the plan file at .claude/plans/twinkling-booping-nest.md — ready for vision spec synthesis in next session.'
